#. translators: Skill feature: mosaic-pro
#: includes/i18n-data-strings.php:547
msgid "Refine one element by name or by its words, without rebuilding the page"
msgstr "Rifinisci un elemento per nome o per testo, senza ricostruire la pagina"

#. translators: Skill feature: paper-pro
#: includes/i18n-data-strings.php:551
msgid "Refuses clamp() for font-size, because the text sizes here are tokens and the validator rejects it"
msgstr "Rifiuta clamp() per font-size, perché qui le dimensioni del testo sono token e il validatore lo respinge"

#. translators: Skill feature: builderius-pro
#: includes/i18n-data-strings.php:553
msgid "Refuses to commit over a published release — and names the release and the commit it serves"
msgstr "Si rifiuta di salvare sopra una release pubblicata, e indica la release e il commit che serve"

#. translators: Skill feature: bricksed-pro; Skill feature: etchedy-pro
